Assertion:
=============
Verify the Test outcomes

Types of assertion :
-------------------
 - Hard assertion
 - Soft assertion

 ------------------------
 1)hard Assertion (Execution stop immediately once any assertion failed )
 Use :Assert class(all methodsstatic)
 methods(mostly used)
 ------
   - Assert.assertEquals(cond, cond)
   - Assert.assertNotEquals(cond, cond)
   - Assert.assertTrue(cond)
   - Assert.assertFalse(cond)
   -Assert. assertNull(condtion)
   - Assert.assertNotNull(cond)

 ----------------------------
 2)Soft Assertion
   - Exeution won't stop , it will continue but assertion failed and error show in the end

 Define:
     SoftAssert sa=new SoftAssert();

 use all methods same as in Hard assertion using the 'SoftAssert' class object
     - sa.assertEquals(cond, cond)
 use below comment to show the assertion error and make the test failed
    -sa.assertAll()

